    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35964" root="قعد" body-key="q">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَعِيدَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A thing like the</i> [<i>kind of receptacle
called</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَيْبَة</span>, (L, K,) <i>woven by women,</i> (L,) <i>upon
which one sits:</i> (L, K:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَعَائِدُ</span>. (L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَعَدَةٌ</span> ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <i>A</i> [<i>sack of the kind called</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غِرَارَة</span>: (S, K:)
or the <i>like thereof, in which are put</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَدِيد</span>
[or pieces of flesh-meat, q. v.] <i>and</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَعْك</span>: (L, K:)
pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَعَائِدُ</span>. (S, L.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  <i>A sand that is not of an oblong form:</i> (S, L, K:) or <i>a long tract of sand like
a rope, cleaving to the ground:</i> (L, K:) or <i>a
heap of sand collected together.</i> (L.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A4-  See also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَعِيدٌ</span>.

